      "spam": false,
      "value": "Yes Please! I have multiple avatars who don't have hands and I can't kneel down or make proper animations with. Characters like King DEDEDE and Mr. Meeseeks don't have fingers, but rather a Glove-like hand, and giving extra fingers in the mesh really messes up the hands. Every time I just look around my character slides instead of walk to compensate for the position of my head. I feel like this is not upvoted enough.",
